Oh, I see.  I thought it came from something specific you were doing with nimble.  Instead it must be something generic your compiler wants to use?  The error message doesn't seem to be that it can't find it but rather that permissions don't grant you access to it.  Do you specifically know of a change in your system's configuration? Have you installed any parts of your system recently, like an update to XCode on OS X, which may need you to launch it once outside of R to give it permissions?  Can you see the files in the given location and look at their permissions?  Otherwise this is fairly hard for us to help with.  It looks like it has to do with your configuration, not nimble per se, as far as I can see right now.

