Do you have some updates on this problem?
I'm having the same issue when trying to fit a Hierarchical distance sampling model with a robust design (following the example 9.6 from AHM Book).
The example rans quite fine, but when it comes to my personal data, it's just a mess with the slice sampler. I've trying several kinds of initial values, but no fix yet.

Thanks.

Guillaume

